00:04:19.375 --> 00:04:22.083
<i>Maaf sekali, tapi aku tak bisa datang.</i>

00:04:22.166 --> 00:04:23.500
Ya, aku mengerti.

00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:24.583
Tentu saja.

00:04:25.208 --> 00:04:27.958
