00:04:41.708 --> 00:04:43.541
<i>Aku harus masuk lagi, tapi…</i>

00:04:43.625 --> 00:04:44.791
Aku menyayangimu.

00:04:44.875 --> 00:04:45.958
<i>Aku menyayangimu.</i>

00:04:51.541 --> 00:04:53.208
Kau ikut, Bobble?

00:05:01.416 --> 00:05:02.791
TERIMA KASIH TELAH MELAMAR

